    "description": "DOUTOR NICHIRES Holdings Co., Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, operates and manages coffee shops and restaurants in Japan. It manufactures and sells breads and western-style confectionery; roasts, processes, and sells coffee; and imports, exports, purchases, and sells food products, as well as recruits and guides restaurant franchisees through a franchise chain system. The company is also involved in the manufacture and wholesale of confectionery products; management of bakery shops; wholesale of coffee machines, etc.; purchase and wholesale of fruits and vegetables; purchase, processing, and wholesale of meat products; manufacture of hams, sausages, and bacons; manufacture and wholesale of sauces and dressing products; and import of coffee beans and tea. In addition, it designs, constructs, maintains, and cleans stores; and operates natural food stores; produces hydroponic vegetables; distributes processed food; and engages in the logistic business, as well as offers online mail orders and delivery services. DOUTOR NICHIRES Holdings Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 2007 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
